+    /** Returns vector (dx, dy) multiplied by SkMatrix, treating SkMatrix translation as zero.
+        Given:
+
+                     | A B 0 |         | dx |
+            Matrix = | D E 0 |,  vec = | dy |
+                     | G H I |         |  1 |
+
+        each result vector is computed as:
+
+                       |A B 0| |dx|                                        A*dx+B*dy     D*dx+E*dy
+        Matrix * vec = |D E 0| |dy| = |A*dx+B*dy D*dx+E*dy G*dx+H*dy+I| = ----------- , -----------
