+ * global gLogCallsGL. The initial value of gLogCallsGL is controlled by
+ * GR_GL_LOG_CALLS_START.
+ *
+ * GR_GL_LOG_CALLS_START: controls the initial value of gLogCallsGL when
+ * GR_GL_LOG_CALLS is 1. Defaults to 0.
